---
<BaseLayout title="Accommodation"><PageHeader eyebrow="Venue &amp; Travel" title="Accommodation" intro="Accommodation and meals are arranged independently by participants." /><section class="section"><div class="container narrow prose"><h2>Accommodation</h2><p>Participants are responsible for arranging their own accommodation.</p><p>Accommodation is not provided by the workshop.</p><h2>Meals</h2><p>Participants are responsible for arranging their own meals. The workshop will provide conference lunch and tea/coffee only.</p></div></section></BaseLayout>
